// ── T8: Headless CMS — BlogPost, BlogCategory, Testimonial, Partner, FacultyBio,
//    ContentPage, NewsletterSubscription, ContactSubmission, CareerApplication ────────
// So `web` stops hardcoding blog/testimonials/partners/faculty/pages content (docs/
// plans/phase-9-completion.md T8/T22/T32). `body`/`content` fields carry rich text/
// MDX-ish content — MUST be sanitized (DOMPurify) at every render sink (same rule as
// ForumPost.body, docs/plans/phase-6.md WS-4); the server stores raw authored content
// (CRM-only write access) and does not attempt HTML sanitization itself.

model BlogCategory {
